    "text": "SPACEXNext SpaceX rocket launch in Florida set for predawn Thursday Brooke EdwardsFlorida TodayMarch 18, 2026Updated March 19, 2026, 5:25 a.m. ETLive updates for Thursday's SpaceX rocket launch in Florida can be found here.After lighting up a dreary and cold St. Patrick's Day morning in Florida, SpaceX plans the next rocket launch before dawn Thursday.The liftoff is set for no earlier than 6:35 a.m. March 19 from Launch Complex 40 at Cape Canaveral Space Force Station. If needed, SpaceX has until 10:35 a.m. to make the liftoff.",
